flowchart TB
    U[Users / Browsers] --> R53[Route 53 - optional custom DNS]
    R53 --> CF[CloudFront - HTTPS viewer]
    CF --> WAF[AWS WAF - Regional Web ACL on ALB]
    WAF --> ALB[Application Load Balancer - public subnets]
    RHC[Route 53 HTTP health check] -.->|GET /health| ALB
    subgraph VPC["VPC - two Availability Zones"]
      direction TB
      IGW[Internet Gateway]
      subgraph AZA["Availability Zone A"]
        PUBA[Public subnet A]
        NATA[NAT Gateway A]
        APPA[Private application subnet A]
        ECA[EC2 instance - ASG]
        DBA[Private database subnet A]
      end
      subgraph AZB["Availability Zone B"]
        PUBB[Public subnet B]
        NATB[NAT Gateway B]
        APPB[Private application subnet B]
        ECB[EC2 instance - ASG]
        DBB[Private database subnet B]
      end
      ALB --> ECA
      ALB --> ECB
      ECA -->|PostgreSQL TLS 5432| RDS[(Amazon RDS PostgreSQL - Multi-AZ)]
      ECB -->|PostgreSQL TLS 5432| RDS
      ECA --> NATA
      ECB --> NATB
      IGW --- PUBA
      IGW --- PUBB
      NATA --- PUBA
      NATB --- PUBB
      ECA --- APPA
      ECB --- APPB
      RDS --- DBA
      RDS --- DBB
    end
    ECA --> SM[Systems Manager]
    ECB --> SM
    ECA --> SEC[Secrets Manager - app DB secret]
    ECB --> SEC
    ECA --> CW[CloudWatch metrics / alarms / dashboard]
    ECB --> CW
    ASG[Auto Scaling - target tracking + step scaling] --> CW
    CW --> SNS[SNS email notifications]
    CF -.-> STATIC[Static assets /static/* cached]
